      384     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      385   end.
      386   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      387     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      388   end.
      389   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
      390     run proc-alt-f1 in this-procedure .
      391   end.
